{"uid":"b99b2eca78c08a6a","name":"test_remove_attached_skill_from_agent","fullName":"tests.ui.skills.test_remove_attached_skill_from_agent.TestRemoveAttachedSkillFromAgent#test_remove_attached_skill_from_agent","historyId":"b58dea0eebd4876217d6bb2fd4d548d5","time":{"start":1786954282940,"stop":1786954361439,"duration":78499},"description":"Create two Skills + an Agent, attach both, remove Skill B via the\n        hover-revealed remove control + confirmation dialog, and verify Skill\n        A remains attached while Skill B survives standalone.\n\n        Steps (AFS test-specs/skills/l3_remove-attached-skill-from-agent_ELITEA-1792.md):\n        1. Create Skill A and Skill B via UI.\n        2. Create an Agent.\n        3. Attach both Skills to the Agent (precondition for this case).\n        4. Locate the hover-revealed \"remove skill\" control for Skill B.\n        5. Click it; confirm the \"Remove skill?\" dialog; Skill B is removed\n           from the UI list while Skill A remains.\n        6. Confirm persistence via a full page reload (detach auto-saves via\n           API; no explicit agent-level Save is available for this action).\n        7. Reopen the Agent (same reload satisfies this — no separate\n           close/reopen gesture exists in the live flow); only Skill A is\n           attached.\n        8. Navigate directly to Skill B's detail page and to the Skills list;\n           Skill B still exists standalone (detached, not deleted).\n        ","descriptionHtml":"<p>Create two Skills + an Agent, attach both, remove Skill B via the<br />\nhover-revealed remove control + confirmation dialog, and verify Skill<br />\nA remains attached while Skill B survives standalone.</p>\n<pre><code>    Steps (AFS test-specs/skills/l3_remove-attached-skill-from-agent_ELITEA-1792.md):\n    1. Create Skill A and Skill B via UI.\n    2. Create an Agent.\n    3. Attach both Skills to the Agent (precondition for this case).\n    4. Locate the hover-revealed &quot;remove skill&quot; control for Skill B.\n    5. Click it; confirm the &quot;Remove skill?&quot; dialog; Skill B is removed\n       from the UI list while Skill A remains.\n    6. Confirm persistence via a full page reload (detach auto-saves via\n       API; no explicit agent-level Save is available for this action).\n    7. Reopen the Agent (same reload satisfies this — no separate\n       close/reopen gesture exists in the live flow); only Skill A is\n       attached.\n    8. Navigate directly to Skill B's detail page and to the Skills list;\n       Skill B still exists standalone (detached, not deleted).\n</code></pre>\n","status":"passed","flaky":false,"newFailed":false,"newBroken":false,"newPassed":false,"retriesCount":0,"retriesStatusChange":false,"beforeStages":[{"name":"base_url","time":{"start":1786953881068,"stop":1786953881068,"duration":0},"status":"passed","steps":[],"attachments":[],"parameters":[],"shouldDisplayMessage":false,"stepsCount":0,"attachmentsCount":0,"hasContent":false,"attachmentStep":false},{"name":"delete_output_dir","time":{"start":1786953881069,"stop":1786953881069,"duration":0},"status":"passed","steps":[],"attachments":[],"parameters":[],"shouldDisplayMessage":false,"stepsCount":0,"attachmentsCount":0,"hasContent":false,"attachmentStep":false},{"name":"pytestconfig","time":{"start":1786953881069,"stop":1786953881069,"duration":0},"status":"passed","steps":[],"attachments":[],"parameters":[],"shouldDisplayMessage":false,"stepsCount":0,"attachmentsCount":0,"hasContent":false,"attachmentStep":false},{"name":"_verify_url","time":{"start":1786953881069,"stop":1786953881069,"duration":0},"status":"passed","steps":[],"attachments":[],"parameters":[],"shouldDisplayMessage":false,"stepsCount":0,"attachmentsCount":0,"hasContent":false,"attachmentStep":false},{"name":"browser","time":{"start":1786953881069,"stop":1786953881590,"duration":521},"status":"passed","steps":[],"attachments":[],"parameters":[],"shouldDisplayMessage":false,"stepsCount":0,"attachmen